    "name": "Pieces Left Behind",
    "steam_appid": 3668830,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A granddaughter. A lifetime of memories. A story woven through the objects left behind.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Pieces Left Behind</strong>, you play as Meredith Carter, returning to her late grandmother\u2019s home to sort through a lifetime of belongings.<br>Each item holds echoes of Margaret &quot;Peggy&quot; Carter\u2019s life, shaped by war, love, hardship, and hope across generations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a narrative-driven walking simulator without combat or puzzles. Instead, you engage with letters, journals, and keepsakes to uncover deeply personal stories from 1940 to 2025.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pieces Left Behind</strong> offers a quiet and reflective journey about memory, loss, and the enduring ties that connect generations.<br>It is brought to life through immersive voice acting, atmospheric visuals, and historically inspired environments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game will launch on May 16, 2025.<br>Add it to your Wishlist and discover the memories left behind.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A granddaughter. A lifetime of memories. A story woven through the objects left behind.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Pieces Left Behind</strong>, you play as Meredith Carter, returning to her late grandmother\u2019s home to sort through a lifetime of belongings.<br>Each item holds echoes of Margaret &quot;Peggy&quot; Carter\u2019s life, shaped by war, love, hardship, and hope across generations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a narrative-driven walking simulator without combat or puzzles. Instead, you engage with letters, journals, and keepsakes to uncover deeply personal stories from 1940 to 2025.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pieces Left Behind</strong> offers a quiet and reflective journey about memory, loss, and the enduring ties that connect generations.<br>It is brought to life through immersive voice acting, atmospheric visuals, and historically inspired environments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game will launch on May 16, 2025.<br>Add it to your Wishlist and discover the memories left behind.</p>",
    "short_description": "After her passing, a grandmother\u2019s home holds decades of untold memories. Step into a heartfelt narrative journey through objects, voice acting, and beautifully crafted environments.",
